    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Support Combat Skills with Arcane Magic</p></blockquote><p>Eldritch Knights combine the martial mastery of all Fighters with a careful study of magic. Their spells complement and extend their combat skills, shoring up their armor and letting them take on many foes at once with explosive magic.</p><h3>Eldritch Knight Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Ud8LbQSSqYBJAg7W]{Spellcasting}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jzALEZw6oT4Uhm2M]{War Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.I17WmfwBZkElM2ym]{War Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.QmTdto4mIHQKSQbw]{Eldritch Strike}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.3cj87KiJghFHtmDD]{Arcane Charge}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.5DGEuQLqj8cX8khR]{Improved War Magic}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
